  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Initiation Plan is required to enable the immediate launch of three strategic pilot interventions that address urgent urban governance priorities in the City of Skopje while laying the foundation for long-term systemic reform. By modernizing local tax administration, the Plan strengthens fiscal sustainability, revenue collection, financial transparency, and urban planning. Through a high-level international conference, it positions Skopje in European cultural and urban policy networks, advan</narrative>
  </description>
